  "summary": "The storage services beyond S3, EBS and EFS: Snowball Edge for offline transfer and edge computing (now closed to new customers), the four Amazon FSx file systems, Storage Gateway for hybrid access to S3, Transfer Family for managed SFTP/FTPS/FTP, and DataSync for scheduled online copies. Ends with a side-by-side comparison of every AWS storage option.",
